":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして 交通安全の御守りを買って\nバッグにしまっまて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社をでました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあっ )))\nここからどーしましょぉ。？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰る?  ...ぃゃぃゃ ちゃう\nちょっとお散歩をしよう ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/21/9641035/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず乃木坂にある坂を\n１人でルンルンしながら\n歩いたよっ (・▽・)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も 坂登ってゆけます様に...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いながらねっ ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局そっから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂〜渋谷まで\n歩いて行っちゃいました 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六本木とかも通りながら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永遠にまっすぐ...かなり歩いた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷についてからも\n歩き続けたから,,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日 3時間位\n道、歩き続けた(´▽`)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも その時に感じたことが\nたくさんあったんだお...(´ω`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩いていたら、\nどっかにそれて行く道や\n斜め前に上がって行く階段,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凸凹道や\n氷がまだ残ってて危ない所も\nあった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく今日は寄り道しないで\nおこうと