agraph","text":"お医者さんでもらう\nお薬が入ってる白い袋あるでしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれに「美人になるのど飴」\nって書いてる アメちゃんを\n見つけてしまって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いな(・ω・)と思って\n買っちゃったんだあ ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は朝からずっと\n写真撮影があって\nまた色んな服を着て撮ったよん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい感じに撮れたかなー´・▽・?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして夜は 新しい曲の振り入れ\nをやってきました...´▽`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/21/9641035/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変顔ぉ〜〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blog見てくれて\nありがとん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは皆ちゃま\nおやすみなさいぃぃ(〃ω〃)のし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rottyより 。"}],"source":"archive"}}